@startuml METACITY_05_Simulation_Dataflow
' ============================================================
' METACITY — Simulation & Comparison Data Flow
' Theme: Civic Steel (light professional)
' ============================================================

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #5A6A7A
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3D4A57
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #A8B5C0
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #EAF3F2
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #2A9D8F
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1B2430
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #C5CED6

title <b>METACITY — Simulation & Comparison Flow</b>\n<size:11><color:#5A6A7A>Flagship path: Template → Baseline → Scenario → Evidence</color></size>

|Frontend|
start
:Open project /\nLoad **Nexus City** template;
:Workspace **View** mode\ninspect network layers;

|Backend API|
:Validate scene\n(**schema_version**);
:Persist project + scene JSON;

|Frontend|
:Enqueue **baseline** run\nseeds 0–9;

|Job Manager|
:Create 10 jobs\nstate = queued;

fork
  |Worker|
  :Load world from scene;
  :Apply **demand profiles**\n(AM / PM peaks);
  :Run **metacity_core**\nrouting · BPR · MSA;
  :Write Parquet KPIs +\nmeta (seed, gap, versions);
  :Publish WS progress;
fork again
  |Worker|
  :… parallel replications …;
end fork

|Frontend|
:Live congestion /\n**flow animation** via WS;
:Create scenario\n(e.g. highway bypass)\nor load **preset**;

|Backend API|
:Validate scenario diff;
:Enqueue scenario runs\n(**same seeds**);

|Job Manager|
:Workers run scenario\nreplications;

|Comparison Service|
:Pair results by seed;
:Compute mean Δ + **95% CI**;
:Label distinguishable /\ninconclusive;
:Attach **calibration badge**\n+ MVP-lite mechanism (top 3);

|Frontend|
:Comparison Result page\ntable · charts · badge;
:Optional HTML report +\nscreenshots;

|Trust Gate|
if (calibration_status?) then (synthetic_uncalibrated)
  :Show amber badge +\nassumptions drawer;
else (calibrated later)
  :Show green badge +\nerror metrics;
endif

stop

legend right
  |= Stage |= Owner |
  | Template / Edit | Frontend + Scene Service |
  | Multi-seed run | Job Manager + Core |
  | Evidence | Comparison + Trust UI |
  | Honesty rule | Always show badge + seeds + model_version |
endlegend

footer METACITY · Simulation Data Flow · MVP Flagship Path

@enduml
